AudioKodec
Copyright 2026 yuroyami

This product contains Kotlin Multiplatform implementations of established
audio container and coding formats.

The following components were written from published specifications:

  RIFF WAVE and WAVE_FORMAT_EXTENSIBLE   Microsoft multimedia programming
                                         documentation
  RF64 and BW64                          EBU Tech 3306, EBU Tech 3285
  Wave64                                 Sony Wave64 specification
  AIFF and AIFF-C                        Apple Audio Interchange File Format
                                         1.3 and AIFF-C
  AU                                     Sun and NeXT audio file format
                                         documentation
  A-law and mu-law                       ITU-T Recommendation G.711
  IMA and DVI ADPCM                      IMA Digital Audio Focus and Technical
                                         Working Group recommended practices,
                                         and Microsoft's IMA ADPCM WAVE type
                                         documentation
  Microsoft ADPCM                        Microsoft ADPCM WAVE type
                                         documentation
  QuickTime IMA (ima4)                   Apple QuickTime File Format
                                         documentation
  G.722 and G.726                        ITU-T Recommendations G.722 (11/88)
                                         and G.726 (12/90)
  iLBC storage format                    IETF RFC 3952, section 4.1
  Matroska and WebM                      IETF RFC 9559 and RFC 8794
  AC-3                                   ATSC A/52:2012, Digital Audio
                                         Compression Standard (AC-3, E-AC-3)
  zlib inflate                           IETF RFC 1950 and RFC 1951

